# Example CODEOWNERS entries for AI agent configuration, instruction files and gates.
# Copy the relevant lines into .github/CODEOWNERS and require code-owner review in
# branch protection or the ruleset ("require_code_owner_reviews" /
# "require_code_owner_review"). Replace the team names with your own.
# Review bots can read instruction files from the PR branch, so a PR must not be
# able to change its own review rules without a code owner.

# Gates and CI
/.github/workflows/                 @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.github/pull_request_template.md   @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.github/approved-components.json   @your-org/qms-code-owners

# Claude Code
/CLAUDE.md                          @your-org/qms-code-owners
**/CLAUDE.md                        @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.claude/                           @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.mcp.json                          @your-org/qms-code-owners

# Codex and shared agent instructions
/AGENTS.md                          @your-org/qms-code-owners
**/AGENTS.md                        @your-org/qms-code-owners
**/AGENTS.override.md               @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.codex/                            @your-org/qms-code-owners

# GitHub Copilot and Cursor (if used)
/.github/copilot-instructions.md    @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.github/instructions/              @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.github/hooks/                     @your-org/qms-code-owners
/.cursor/                           @your-org/qms-code-owners
